                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The Chukchee are very much afraid of this disease, since it occurs so often."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l5" HPOS="723" VPOS="833" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="723 878 2490 878" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="723 878 723 891 2486 896 2490 878 2490 848 2447 833 2445 833 2442 833 2323 846 2208 833 2206 833 2204 833 2150 846 2109 833 2107 833 2016 833 2014 833 2011 833 1985 846 1949 833 1946 833 1944 833 1942 833 1910 844 1864 833 1862 833 1860 833 1858 833 1855 833 1836 846 1723 833 1721 833 1719 833 1665 846 1619 833 1617 833 1615 833 1613 833 1580 848 1453 848 1424 833 1422 833 1420 833 1271 848 1152 848 1132 833 1130 833 1128 833 1126 833 1123 833 1091 846 1054 833 1052 833 1050 833 978 846 911 833 909 833 907 833 905 833 887 844 857 833 855 833 853 833 851 833 807 846 723 842 723 878"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="In 1896, while I was travelling on the Upper Anui, all the Chaun people,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l6" HPOS="718" VPOS="902" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="721 937 2492 933" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 937 721 952 2490 948 2492 933 2488 902 718 902 721 937"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="hearing of some cases of the disease on the Wolverine River, fled from the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l7" HPOS="718" VPOS="954" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="721 998 2490 993" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 998 721 1013 2486 1017 2490 993 2486 963 762 954 760 954 757 954 718 965 721 998"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="whole western part of the Chaun tundra in order to avoid the “spirits seeking"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l8" HPOS="718" VPOS="1015" WIDTH="226" HEIGHT="69" BASELINE="718 1056 944 1056" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="718 1056 718 1071 792 1071 805 1082 805 1084 807 1084 809 1084 812 1084 944 1069 944 1056 942 1015 718 1024 718 1056"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="for prey.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_1-064_r3" HPOS="721" VPOS="1081" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="477" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="721 1081 2499 1081 2499 1558 721 1558"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l9" HPOS="822" VPOS="1071" WIDTH="1670" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="825 1117 2492 1110" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="825 1117 825 1132 2490 1125 2492 1110 2488 1080 1379 1071 1377 1071 1375 1071 1334 1082 840 1073 838 1073 835 1073 833 1073 822 1080 825 1117"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Of nervous diseases, which are also dreaded and considered “subject to"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l10" HPOS="714" VPOS="1130" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="716 1177 2492 1171" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="716 1177 716 1192 2490 1186 2492 1171 2490 1143 2462 1130 2460 1130 2458 1130 2455 1130 2434 1140 2202 1130 2200 1130 2198 1130 2195 1130 2180 1143 2057 1143 2009 1130 2007 1130 2005 1130 1886 1143 1834 1132 1832 1132 1483 1143 1418 1132 1416 1132 1305 1145 1243 1134 1240 1134 1033 1145 1017 1134 1015 1134 1013 1134 747 1134 744 1134 742 1134 714 1145 716 1177"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="shunning,” I may make mention of iteˊyun, akin to epilepsy. Sometimes it"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l11" HPOS="716" VPOS="1192" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="74" BASELINE="718 1238 2492 1231" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="718 1238 718 1266 868 1251 1331 1262 1334 1262 1336 1262 1338 1262 1353 1251 1840 1260 1842 1260 2167 1247 2202 1257 2204 1257 2206 1260 2403 1260 2403 1257 2406 1257 2429 1247 2445 1257 2447 1257 2449 1257 2451 1257 2453 1257 2492 1244 2492 1231 2488 1192 1845 1192 1842 1192 1765 1203 1678 1192 1676 1192 1600 1203 1206 1195 1204 1195 1108 1205 924 1195 922 1195 716 1208 718 1238"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="occurs with the usual fits; sometimes with convulsions or with contraction of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l12" HPOS="718" VPOS="1257" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="721 1296 2490 1290" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 1296 721 1314 2488 1309 2490 1290 2483 1257 718 1266 721 1296"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the muscles, amounting almost to a temporary catalepsy. It lasts for several"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l13" HPOS="718" VPOS="1309" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="721 1357 2488 1348" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 1357 721 1376 2486 1368 2488 1348 2483 1320 2130 1309 2128 1309 2040 1322 718 1322 721 1357"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="hours, and the patient is unconscious during the whole time; then it gradually"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l14" HPOS="718" VPOS="1383" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="721 1420 2488 1413" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 1420 721 1439 2486 1426 2488 1413 2481 1383 718 1387 721 1420"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="passes away, but in a few days returns, perhaps in a more violent form."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l15" HPOS="718" VPOS="1431" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="721 1478 2488 1472" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 1478 721 1493 2486 1487 2488 1472 2483 1441 1925 1431 1923 1431 1920 1431 1892 1444 718 1444 721 1478"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Iteˊyun progresses rapidly, and invariably ends in the death of the sufferer."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-064_l16" HPOS="718" VPOS="1500" WIDTH="1384" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="721 1530 2102 1534" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="721 1530 718 1545 2098 1550 2102 1534 2100 1504 721 1500 721 1530"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Sometimes, however, it lasts for years before the fatal issue."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
